      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "His interactions with the \"system\" would be marked by a deep-seated contempt, viewing the law as an illegitimate, foreign imposition on his community's survival. He wouldn't see the police as legitimate authority figures, but as weak outsiders infringing on his domain. This manifests as a calculated disrespect, where he uses charm and perceived kinship—a false sense of belonging—to manipulate officials, rather than the cold, transactional bribery of a typical white-collar criminal. His loyalty to his own people always supersedes any perceived societal contract.",
